test/check/error-arithmetic-place.sumspec:9:27:
  |
9 | source :: App => Attempts(1 + 1) -> Attempts'
  |                           ^
a computed value (1 + 1) goes only on the target side; to test a value, name it (T#x) and compare it in a guard (// x == ...)

